[
  {
    "content_id": "10025001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;先前滿有人民的城， 現在何竟獨坐！ 先前在列國中為大的， 現在竟如寡婦； 先前在諸省中為王后的， 現在成為進貢的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;她夜間痛哭，淚流滿腮； 在一切所親愛的中間沒有一個安慰她的。 她的朋友都以詭詐待她， 成為她的仇敵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;猶大因遭遇苦難， 又因多服勞苦就遷到外邦。 她住在列國中，尋不着安息； 追逼她的都在狹窄之地將她追上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;錫安的路徑因無人來守聖節就悲傷； 她的城門淒涼； 她的祭司歎息； 她的處女受艱難，自己也愁苦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;她的敵人為首； 她的仇敵亨通； 因耶和華為她許多的罪過使她受苦； 她的孩童被敵人擄去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;錫安城的威榮全都失去。 她的首領像找不着草場的鹿； 在追趕的人前無力行走。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷在困苦窘迫之時， 就追想古時一切的樂境。 她百姓落在敵人手中，無人救濟； 敵人看見，就因她的荒涼嗤笑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷大大犯罪， 所以成為不潔之物； 素來尊敬她的，見她赤露就都藐視她； 她自己也歎息退後。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;她的污穢是在衣襟上； 她不思想自己的結局， 所以非常地敗落， 無人安慰她。 她說：耶和華啊，求你看我的苦難， 因為仇敵誇大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;敵人伸手，奪取她的美物； 她眼見外邦人進入她的聖所－ 論這外邦人，你曾吩咐不可入你的會中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;她的民都歎息，尋求食物； 他們用美物換糧食，要救性命。 他們說：耶和華啊，求你觀看， 因為我甚是卑賤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你們一切過路的人哪，這事你們不介意嗎？ 你們要觀看： 有像這臨到我的痛苦沒有－ 就是耶和華在他發烈怒的日子使我所受的苦？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他從高天使火進入我的骨頭， 剋制了我； 他鋪下網羅，絆我的腳， 使我轉回； 他使我終日淒涼發昏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我罪過的軛是他手所綁的， 猶如軛繩縛在我頸項上； 他使我的力量衰敗。 主將我交在我所不能敵擋的人手中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;主輕棄我中間的一切勇士， 招聚多人攻擊我， 要壓碎我的少年人。 主將猶大居民踹下， 像在酒醡中一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我因這些事哭泣； 我眼淚汪汪； 因為那當安慰我、救我性命的， 離我甚遠。 我的兒女孤苦， 因為仇敵得了勝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;錫安舉手，無人安慰。 耶和華論雅各已經出令， 使四圍的人作他仇敵； 耶路撒冷在他們中間像不潔之物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;耶和華是公義的！ 他這樣待我，是因我違背他的命令。 眾民哪，請聽我的話， 看我的痛苦； 我的處女和少年人都被擄去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我招呼我所親愛的， 他們卻愚弄我。 我的祭司和長老正尋求食物、救性命的時候， 就在城中絕氣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，求你觀看， 因為我在急難中。 我心腸擾亂； 我心在我裏面翻轉， 因我大大悖逆。 在外，刀劍使人喪子； 在家，猶如死亡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;聽見我歎息的有人； 安慰我的卻無人！ 我的仇敵都聽見我所遭的患難； 因你做這事，他們都喜樂。 你必使你報告的日子來到， 他們就像我一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25001022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;願他們的惡行都呈在你面前； 你怎樣因我的一切罪過待我， 求你照樣待他們； 因我歎息甚多，心中發昏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;主何竟發怒，使黑雲遮蔽錫安城！ 他將以色列的華美從天扔在地上； 在他發怒的日子並不記念自己的腳凳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;主吞滅雅各一切的住處，並不顧惜。 他發怒傾覆猶大民的保障， 使這保障坍倒在地； 他辱沒這國和其中的首領。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他發烈怒，把以色列的角全然砍斷， 在仇敵面前收回右手。 他像火焰四圍吞滅，將雅各燒毀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他張弓好像仇敵； 他站着舉起右手， 如同敵人將悅人眼目的，盡行殺戮。 在錫安百姓的帳棚上 倒出他的忿怒，像火一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;主如仇敵吞滅以色列和錫安的一切宮殿， 拆毀百姓的保障； 在猶大民中加增悲傷哭號。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他強取自己的帳幕，好像是園中的窩棚， 毀壞他的聚會之處。 耶和華使聖節和安息日在錫安都被忘記， 又在怒氣的憤恨中藐視君王和祭司。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;耶和華丟棄自己的祭壇， 憎惡自己的聖所， 將宮殿的牆垣交付仇敵。 他們在耶和華的殿中喧嚷， 像在聖會之日一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和華定意拆毀錫安的城牆； 他拉了準繩， 不將手收回，定要毀滅。 他使外郭和城牆都悲哀， 一同衰敗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;錫安的門都陷入地內； 主將她的門閂毀壞，折斷。 她的君王和首領落在沒有律法的列國中； 她的先知不得見耶和華的異象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;錫安城的長老坐在地上默默無聲； 他們揚起塵土落在頭上，腰束麻布； 耶路撒冷的處女垂頭至地。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我眼中流淚，以致失明； 我的心腸擾亂，肝膽塗地， 都因我眾民遭毀滅， 又因孩童和吃奶的在城內街上發昏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;那時，他們在城內街上發昏，好像受傷的， 在母親的懷裏，將要喪命； 對母親說：穀、酒在哪裏呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;耶路撒冷的民哪，我可用甚麼向你證明呢？ 我可用甚麼與你相比呢？ 錫安的民哪，我可拿甚麼和你比較，好安慰你呢？ 因為你的裂口大如海， 誰能醫治你呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你的先知為你見虛假和愚昧的異象， 並沒有顯露你的罪孽， 使你被擄的歸回； 卻為你見虛假的默示 和使你被趕出本境的緣故。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;凡過路的都向你拍掌。 他們向耶路撒冷城嗤笑，搖頭，說： 難道人所稱為全美的， 稱為全地所喜悅的，就是這城嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你的仇敵都向你大大張口； 他們嗤笑，又切齒說： 我們吞滅她。 這真是我們所盼望的日子臨到了！ 我們親眼看見了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;耶和華成就了他所定的， 應驗了他古時所命定的。 他傾覆了，並不顧惜， 使你的仇敵向你誇耀； 使你敵人的角也被高舉。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;錫安民的心哀求主。 錫安的城牆啊，願你流淚如河， 晝夜不息； 願你眼中的瞳人淚流不止。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;夜間，每逢交更的時候要起來呼喊， 在主面前傾心如水。 你的孩童在各市口上受餓發昏； 你要為他們的性命向主舉手禱告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，求你觀看！ 見你向誰這樣行？ 婦人豈可吃自己所生育手裏所搖弄的嬰孩嗎？ 祭司和先知豈可在主的聖所中被殺戮嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;少年人和老年人都在街上躺臥； 我的處女和壯丁都倒在刀下； 你發怒的日子殺死他們。 你殺了，並不顧惜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你招聚四圍驚嚇我的， 像在大會的日子招聚人一樣。 耶和華發怒的日子， 無人逃脫，無人存留。 我所搖弄所養育的嬰孩， 仇敵都殺淨了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我是因耶和華忿怒的杖， 遭遇困苦的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他引導我，使我行在黑暗中， 不行在光明裏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;他真是終日再三反手攻擊我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;他使我的皮肉枯乾； 他折斷我的骨頭。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他築壘攻擊我， 用苦楚和艱難圍困我。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他使我住在幽暗之處， 像死了許久的人一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他用籬笆圍住我，使我不能出去； 他使我的銅鍊沉重。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我哀號求救； 他使我的禱告不得上達。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;他用鑿過的石頭擋住我的道； 他使我的路彎曲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;他向我如熊埋伏， 如獅子在隱密處。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;他使我轉離正路， 將我撕碎，使我淒涼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他張弓將我當作箭靶子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他把箭袋中的箭射入我的肺腑。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我成了眾民的笑話； 他們終日以我為歌曲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;他用苦楚充滿我，使我飽用茵蔯。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;他又用沙石磣斷我的牙， 用灰塵將我蒙蔽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;你使我遠離平安， 我忘記好處。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我就說：我的力量衰敗； 我在耶和華那裏毫無指望！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，求你記念我 如茵蔯和苦膽的困苦窘迫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我心想念這些， 就在裏面憂悶。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我想起這事， 心裏就有指望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;我們不致消滅， 是出於耶和華諸般的慈愛； 是因他的憐憫不致斷絕。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;每早晨，這都是新的； 你的誠實極其廣大！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;我心裏說：耶和華是我的分， 因此，我要仰望他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;凡等候耶和華，心裏尋求他的， 耶和華必施恩給他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;人仰望耶和華， 靜默等候他的救恩， 這原是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;人在幼年負軛， 這原是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003028",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;他當獨坐無言， 因為這是耶和華加在他身上的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003029",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;他當口貼塵埃， 或者有指望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003030",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:30",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003030",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>30</sup>&nbsp;他當由人打他的腮頰， 要滿受凌辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003031",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:31",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003031",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>31</sup>&nbsp;因為主必不永遠丟棄人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003032",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:32",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003032",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>32</sup>&nbsp;主雖使人憂愁， 還要照他諸般的慈愛發憐憫。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003033",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:33",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003033",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>33</sup>&nbsp;因他並不甘心使人受苦， 使人憂愁。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003034",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:34",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003034",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>34</sup>&nbsp;人將世上被囚的踹在腳下，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003035",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:35",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003035",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>35</sup>&nbsp;或在至高者面前屈枉人，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003036",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:36",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003036",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>36</sup>&nbsp;或在人的訟事上顛倒是非， 這都是主看不上的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003037",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:37",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003037",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>37</sup>&nbsp;除非主命定， 誰能說成就成呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003038",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:38",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003038",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>38</sup>&nbsp;禍福不都出於至高者的口嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003039",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:39",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003039",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>39</sup>&nbsp;活人因自己的罪受罰， 為何發怨言呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003040",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:40",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003040",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>40</sup>&nbsp;我們當深深考察自己的行為， 再歸向耶和華。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003041",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:41",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003041",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>41</sup>&nbsp;我們當誠心向天上的上帝舉手禱告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003042",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:42",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003042",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>42</sup>&nbsp;我們犯罪背逆， 你並不赦免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003043",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:43",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003043",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>43</sup>&nbsp;你自被怒氣遮蔽，追趕我們； 你施行殺戮，並不顧惜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003044",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:44",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003044",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>44</sup>&nbsp;你以黑雲遮蔽自己， 以致禱告不得透入。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003045",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:45",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003045",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>45</sup>&nbsp;你使我們在萬民中成為污穢和渣滓。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003046",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:46",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003046",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>46</sup>&nbsp;我們的仇敵都向我們大大張口。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003047",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:47",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003047",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>47</sup>&nbsp;恐懼和陷坑，殘害和毀滅， 都臨近我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003048",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:48",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003048",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>48</sup>&nbsp;因我眾民遭的毀滅， 我就眼淚下流如河。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003049",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:49",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003049",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>49</sup>&nbsp;我的眼多多流淚， 總不止息，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003050",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:50",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003050",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>50</sup>&nbsp;直等耶和華垂顧， 從天觀看。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003051",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:51",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003051",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>51</sup>&nbsp;因我本城的眾民， 我的眼，使我的心傷痛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003052",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:52",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003052",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>52</sup>&nbsp;無故與我為仇的追逼我， 像追雀鳥一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003053",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:53",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003053",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>53</sup>&nbsp;他們使我的命在牢獄中斷絕， 並將一塊石頭拋在我身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003054",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:54",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003054",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>54</sup>&nbsp;眾水流過我頭， 我說：我命斷絕了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003055",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:55",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003055",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>55</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊， 我從深牢中求告你的名。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003056",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:56",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003056",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>56</sup>&nbsp;你曾聽見我的聲音； 我求你解救， 你不要掩耳不聽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003057",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:57",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003057",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>57</sup>&nbsp;我求告你的日子，你臨近我， 說：不要懼怕！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003058",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:58",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003058",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>58</sup>&nbsp;主啊，你伸明了我的冤； 你救贖了我的命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003059",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:59",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003059",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>59</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，你見了我受的委屈； 求你為我伸冤。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003060",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:60",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003060",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>60</sup>&nbsp;他們仇恨我，謀害我， 你都看見了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003061",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:61",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003061",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>61</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，你聽見他們辱罵我的話， 知道他們向我所設的計，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003062",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:62",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003062",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>62</sup>&nbsp;並那些起來攻擊我的人口中所說的話， 以及終日向我所設的計謀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003063",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:63",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003063",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>63</sup>&nbsp;求你觀看， 他們坐下，起來，都以我為歌曲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003064",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:64",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003064",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>64</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，你要按着他們手所做的 向他們施行報應。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003065",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:65",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003065",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>65</sup>&nbsp;你要使他們心裏剛硬， 使你的咒詛臨到他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025003066",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 3:66",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25003066",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>66</sup>&nbsp;你要發怒追趕他們， 從耶和華的天下除滅他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;黃金何其失光！ 純金何其變色！ 聖所的石頭倒在各市口上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;錫安寶貴的眾子好比精金， 現在何竟算為窯匠手所做的瓦瓶？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;野狗尚且把奶乳哺其子， 我民的婦人倒成為殘忍， 好像曠野的鴕鳥一般。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;吃奶孩子的舌頭因乾渴貼住上膛； 孩童求餅，無人擘給他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;素來吃美好食物的， 現今在街上變為孤寒； 素來臥朱紅褥子的， 現今躺臥糞堆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;都因我眾民的罪孽比所多瑪的罪還大； 所多瑪雖然無人加手於她， 還是轉眼之間被傾覆。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;錫安的貴冑素來比雪純淨， 比奶更白； 他們的身體比紅寶玉更紅， 像光潤的藍寶石一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;現在他們的面貌比煤炭更黑， 以致在街上無人認識； 他們的皮膚緊貼骨頭， 枯乾如同槁木。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;餓死的不如被刀殺的， 因為這是缺了田間的土產， 就身體衰弱，漸漸消滅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;慈心的婦人，當我眾民被毀滅的時候， 親手煮自己的兒女作為食物。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶和華發怒成就他所定的， 倒出他的烈怒； 在錫安使火着起， 燒毀錫安的根基。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;地上的君王和世上的居民都不信 敵人和仇敵能進耶路撒冷的城門。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;這都因她先知的罪惡和祭司的罪孽； 他們在城中流了義人的血。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;他們在街上如瞎子亂走， 又被血玷污， 以致人不能摸他們的衣服。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;人向他們喊着說： 不潔淨的，躲開，躲開！ 不要挨近我！ 他們逃走飄流的時候， 列國中有人說： 他們不可仍在這裏寄居。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;耶和華發怒，將他們分散， 不再眷顧他們； 人不重看祭司，也不厚待長老。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;我們仰望人來幫助， 以致眼目失明，還是枉然； 我們所盼望的，竟盼望一個不能救人的國！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;仇敵追趕我們的腳步像打獵的， 以致我們不敢在自己的街上行走。 我們的結局臨近； 我們的日子滿足； 我們的結局來到了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;追趕我們的比空中的鷹更快； 他們在山上追逼我們， 在曠野埋伏，等候我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;耶和華的受膏者好比我們鼻中的氣， 在他們的坑中被捉住； 我們曾論到他說： 我們必在他蔭下， 在列國中存活。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;住烏斯地的以東民哪，只管歡喜快樂； 苦杯也必傳到你那裏； 你必喝醉，以致露體。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025004022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 4:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25004022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;錫安的民哪，你罪孽的刑罰受足了， 耶和華必不使你再被擄去。 以東的民哪，他必追討你的罪孽， 顯露你的罪惡。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，求你記念我們所遭遇的事， 觀看我們所受的凌辱。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我們的產業歸與外邦人； 我們的房屋歸與外路人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我們是無父的孤兒； 我們的母親好像寡婦。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我們出錢才得水喝； 我們的柴是人賣給我們的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;追趕我們的，到了我們的頸項上； 我們疲乏不得歇息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我們投降埃及人和亞述人， 為要得糧吃飽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我們列祖犯罪，而今不在了； 我們擔當他們的罪孽。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;奴僕轄制我們， 無人救我們脫離他們的手。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因為曠野的刀劍， 我們冒着險才得糧食。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因飢餓燥熱， 我們的皮膚就黑如爐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;敵人在錫安玷污婦人， 在猶大的城邑玷污處女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;他們吊起首領的手， 也不尊敬老人的面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;少年人扛磨石， 孩童背木柴，都絆跌了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;老年人在城門口斷絕； 少年人不再作樂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;我們心中的快樂止息， 跳舞變為悲哀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;冠冕從我們的頭上落下； 我們犯罪了，我們有禍了！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;這些事我們心裏發昏， 我們的眼睛昏花。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;錫安山荒涼， 野狗行在其上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，你存到永遠； 你的寶座存到萬代。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;你為何永遠忘記我們？ 為何許久離棄我們？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;耶和華啊，求你使我們向你回轉， 我們便得回轉。 求你復新我們的日子，像古時一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10025005022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "耶利米哀歌 5:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "25005022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你竟全然棄絕我們， 向我們大發烈怒？</p>"
  }
]